      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TEXAS BANDIT (1) was below best last time when fifth at Wentworth Park but prior to that among the placings in quick time (24.63) at Goulburn. Better than last run and makes appeal this time. SHREWD (2) caught the eye when posting a dazzling 30.49 over 531m at Gawler. Harder here but will be in this for a long way. PAW SHAYNA (8) had a tough draw to overcome and was game in defeat when only 0.8 lengths from Zipping Migaloo in second (30.98) at this track. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from four starts. Expected to feature again. SOUTHLINE (7) did a good job to finish third last time out over 300m at Murray Bridge (17.36) in a Grade 6, the second top-three finish on the trot.",
